      "content": "but if i just \"let it settle in,\" it doesn't really change the fact that i'm still stuck in this cycle, right? like, if nothing matters, then the effort to keep going through all this pain... isn't that just actually irrational? it feels like there's no logical reason to just keep hurting yourself for a universe that doesn't even notice you're here.",
